@startuml sd_us208
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US208 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AirportController" as AirportController
participant "UpdateAirportDetailsUseCase" as UpdateAirportDetailsUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== PATCH /api/airports/{iataCode}/details ==
Actor -> EAR : PATCH /api/airports/{iataCode}/details\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> UpdateAirportDetailsUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateAirportDetailsUseCase -> DBAR : apply the change to this replica's copy\n+ one copy per other replica in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateAirportDetailsUseCase --> AirportController : updated
AirportController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/airports\n(to every other replica; the latest change wins)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
